# Never ignore Asset meta data and keep Assets/Packages/ProjectSettings
# The following MUST be committed:
#   Assets/          (your shaders, scenes, materials, textures, scripts)
#   Packages/        (manifest.json, packages-lock.json)
#   ProjectSettings/ (ProjectSettings.asset, *.asset, ProjectVersion.txt)
